[{"client_msg_id":"d0795bfe-b3a4-4776-bf29-06a33e00d3a6","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"試してみたけど動いてそうなのでそれ使わせてもらいます！ :kan::sha:","ts":"1624514591.413100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JleT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"235579d9-c63b-46df-a7f3-0b0910e1636c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"すごそうなのが出てきた。空文字列判定に grep がオーバースペック感は若干ありますができそうな感じもしますね！","ts":"1624514464.412500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6tb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ad64066-5db8-4d6f-8b77-b6d5e2feb746","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"```echo \"$(echo bar | grep ^ || echo baz)\"\necho \"$(echo -n | grep ^ || echo baz)\"```\nこれでいけないのかな","ts":"1624514378.411800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01J8RHFH3P"]},{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["URNBMPJ4C","U013APKV51B"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9EoK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e778d2ff-33f7-484b-9b15-2ee14fe4d072","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"```local result=$(cmd1)\necho \"${result:-$(cmd2)}\"```\n今はひとまずこうしていますが、`$result` 変数を使わずにシュッとできないかなって思ったんですが、難しそうですねぇ","ts":"1624514295.410900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TcT7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5cc3e291-65d9-4edc-a9ee-daa6fcfaec13","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`cmd1` の出力が空でなければそれを使う、そうでなければ `cmd2` の出力を使う、ということがやりたかった感じです。それだと `cmd1` の結果を捨てちゃいますね","ts":"1624514228.409800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mJm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f77d7610-9ac7-4b30-9c4a-a4bc5b914998","type":"message","user":"U7H4TJEG0","text":"`if cmd | grep ^` する方法と `if diff \u0026lt;(echo -n) \u0026lt;(cmd)` する方法があります。","ts":"1624514107.409000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LpCa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8f0ecccc-1b7d-4bc6-977e-e11aaae7d3ef","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"今はそうしてるんですが、あんまりスマートじゃない気がしたので、もしもっといい方法があれば知りたいな―って感じでした","ts":"1624513833.408200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HIAj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2015e553-0b16-41a1-a20d-da0697a29719","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"一旦変数に入れれば良いんじゃないでしょうか","ts":"1624513804.407700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wxk7D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4169beb7-b5c1-4fc4-8c96-0366d3bb97d7","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Bash で、変数が空だった代わりにこれを表示、みたいなのは `${FOO:-alt}` みたいな感じで書けると思うんですけど、コマンドの出力結果が空だったら～ をやりたい場合にスマートな方法ってありますかね?","ts":"1624513639.407300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kc15J"}]}]
